Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.95,0:00:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you take these vegetables to Old Lü?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Xiaobai, your teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.63,0:00:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the interpretator.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,On today's lesson,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.01,0:00:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll learn what not to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.98,0:00:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.43,0:01:03.82,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad()}{\pos(1400,520)}Peace and Quiet
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.49,0:01:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, don't disturb my lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see myself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.93,0:01:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've brought some things for demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Which you're eating...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.51,0:01:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! You must listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.51,0:01:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't eat that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:26.37,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.90,0:01:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if you don't listen, you can't stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't feel bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.27,0:01:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get hungry,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.48,0:01:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you lots of wood to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So be a good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.09,0:01:40.13,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I will! I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.84,0:01:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's food motivated...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.73,0:01:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't translate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is convenient!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.10,0:02:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shame it caused so much damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A shark?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.53,0:02:41.54,BG_Sign,,0,0,0,,{\p1}m 100.13 545.13 l 96.88 609.56 l 117.74 609.56 l 174.76 599.83 l 177.54 580.36 l 185.88 590.09 l 191.91 603.53 l 212.77 599.83 l 220.18 579.43 l 232.24 591.95 l 248.46 601.22 l 263.29 609.56 l 268.39 598.44 l 279.05 601.68 l 292.5 597.04 l 300.84 600.29 l 312.43 607.71 l 392.62 607.24 l 446.86 607.71 l 449.17 543.27 l 361.56 543.27 l 274.88 543.74 l 175.22 543.27{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.35,0:02:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite big...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.57,0:02:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A water spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.52,0:02:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it drawn here by the flood?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.22,0:02:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Or driven out from the village by it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.23,0:02:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope it can understand me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.67,0:02:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.67,0:02:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.94,0:02:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I've gone and done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.53,0:02:41.54,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(278,615)\fs(40)}Ancestral Shrine of \NThe Wei Family
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:12.41,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Can I eat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.75,0:03:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, you can eat this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.46,0:03:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.13,0:03:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you healed enough for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.62,0:03:24.16,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.25,0:03:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.61,0:03:29.61,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.49,0:03:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that? I'm a good teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.82,0:03:33.42,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Heixiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.73,0:03:37.34,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Can I eat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.94,0:03:43.00,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Is he going to keep asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.05,0:03:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel we'll have a problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.89,0:03:46.85,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Can I eat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.90,0:03:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to ask every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:15.90,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.70,0:04:17.95,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,If you eat too much, you'll get stuck in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.95,0:04:18.59,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.97,0:04:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:22.55,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,You actually believed that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.92,0:04:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems he's on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.84,0:04:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.29,0:04:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that your ability now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:37.30,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.79,0:04:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.73,0:04:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.16,0:04:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get food without getting out of bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.74,0:04:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu's scared stiff...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.33,0:05:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,100 miles southwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.85,0:05:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.11,0:05:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He fits your description.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.19,0:05:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice type by appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll look into it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.27,0:05:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why look for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.76,0:05:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Laojun announced that the Sky Pearl\Nwas taken the day after we went there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.70,0:05:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.66,0:05:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If Diting and Xuanli were there,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.77,0:05:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,who could have taken the Pearl from them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.35,0:05:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Laojun could.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.64,0:05:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. Who else could?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.05,0:05:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Diting is Laojun's guard dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuanli isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So you think Xuanli took the Pearl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.16,0:06:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm 60 percent sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.61,0:06:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So we must look into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.54,0:06:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But if it's really Xuanli,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.67,0:06:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,we can't stand up against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Head-on attacks are not my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause you're weak at close combat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.92,0:06:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The flood has finally gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.63,0:07:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need to tear down the whole roof...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.35,0:07:09.41,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(455,670)}Power Struggle
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.19,0:07:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be big work...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure I can't ask Laojun for compensation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that big a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.67,0:07:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can fix it easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.85,0:07:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My saved money...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.60,0:07:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The house gets much more light now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So should I build an open-air kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.87,0:07:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.56,0:07:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd die of heat when the air con doesn't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.80,0:07:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1138,375)}{\fs(55)}Air \Ncon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems it will be very hot today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.09,0:08:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.27,0:08:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do the sweeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.39,0:08:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You bring two watermelons from Big Ji's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.68,0:08:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All set.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.76,0:08:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.54,0:08:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Auntie Cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.64,0:08:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening, meow, meow, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.55,0:08:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.15,0:08:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.43,0:08:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Gen finally wants to challenge me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.94,0:08:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here for watermelons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,New guys arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, someone to bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sweep later...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.69,0:08:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, keep an eye on Bidiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:09:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.51,0:09:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.25,0:09:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these two fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.65,0:09:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What you choose is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Only you guys are home?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.82,0:09:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad and Mom are out at the watermelon fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.70,0:09:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.01,0:09:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me he's that strong?\NWould you have believed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe it!\NExactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.48,0:09:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It found us!\NThis one's not so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.37,0:09:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.91,0:09:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!\NWe're already running!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.98,0:09:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A gathering?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.85,0:09:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Big Ji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.44,0:09:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Heixiu, where's everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well. A cat beat you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.56,0:10:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.94,0:10:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you not to mess with us, cats!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.82,0:10:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's stronger than you!\NYou talk like a loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.21,0:10:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then fight him!\NYou don't scare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.63,0:10:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And who gave you that scar on your face?\NWhat about yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.01,0:10:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it when I tripped!\NWe tripped up together!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.01,0:10:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll regret that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.99,0:10:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, newcomer. I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.61,0:10:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so insolent!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.45,0:10:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Gray was careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.33,0:10:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.90,0:10:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.10,0:10:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So Xiaohei found Bidiu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:10:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.71,0:11:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.15,0:12:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The flood has damaged the ancestral shrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.58,0:12:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.27,0:12:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The mayor's asking for donations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.31,0:12:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.60,0:12:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be there shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.87,0:12:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The ancestral shrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.01,0:12:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's home is in a mess now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.79,0:12:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid no one can donate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:27.59,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.47,0:12:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking if we have some money left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.83,0:12:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.87,0:12:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.03,0:12:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You just tell the mayor about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.83,0:12:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll renovate the shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.83,0:12:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you get money?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As far as I know, we've got a check.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.23,0:12:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can claim it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.93,0:12:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.39,0:12:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This would be a great help for the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going too...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.10,0:13:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a bus to town anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.86,0:13:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can visit Shan Xin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.64,0:13:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.80,0:13:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's weird you have clothes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.84,0:13:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You say it like I usually had none on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.96,0:13:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,City Park
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:13:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be, according to the address...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Children!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.94,0:14:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning! We'd like to meet the manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have an appointment?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.78,0:14:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Access card?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.76,0:14:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.49,0:14:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.22,0:14:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Laojun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No good?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.03,0:14:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Children.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.13,0:14:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A paper with a scribble on is not an access card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.39,0:14:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this supposed to be a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.25,0:14:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not completely impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.91,0:14:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.02,0:14:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to sneak in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.62,0:14:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get further from the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.04,0:14:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.90,0:14:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We can get in from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.71,0:15:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But this wall's quite tall...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.85,0:15:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.43,0:15:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.63,0:15:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.59,0:15:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's looking for a landing place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go in first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, and don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We're inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.95,0:15:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you're awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.61,0:15:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like the forest all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.32,0:15:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd be here if we entered at the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we should be around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.85,0:15:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Our destination is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.96,0:15:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know the scale of the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll need to pass a hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.45,0:15:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks pretty far away...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute! Xiaohei could teleport us there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:50.21,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,My limit is 5 yards at the moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.90,0:15:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.83,0:15:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.31,0:16:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The trees here are bigger than the ones in the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.78,0:16:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They're at least several hundred years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.01,0:16:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be well taken care of, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they're unnaturally big.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.85,0:16:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.08,0:16:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.78,0:16:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're that high already?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.43,0:16:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can see our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the visitor's office, according to the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Those buildings in the distance must be our destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There should be spirits there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.98,0:16:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.12,0:16:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone should find us once we're closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.79,0:16:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.32,0:16:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we came, to find someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.77,0:16:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We've found someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you first-time visitors?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.04,0:16:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.71,0:16:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Who introduced you to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.06,0:16:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Laojun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.91,0:16:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.88,0:17:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you are Lord Xuanli.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.35,0:17:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, call me Gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.81,0:17:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us for breaking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone enters like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Tu Bei, the secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.47,0:17:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Our hall manager has been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.98,0:17:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.21,0:17:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hall manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This reminds me of Laojun's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.27,0:17:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you mean by this, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A tiger?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.44,0:17:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.52,0:17:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.98,0:17:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.07,0:17:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He can talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you let a human in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.41,0:17:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He really can talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.24,0:17:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why in godforsaken hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.70,0:17:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A Siberian tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm some country bumpkin because of some words?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.19,0:17:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no rule saying humans can't enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.22,0:18:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Fu, please don't make me intervene.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.36,0:18:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I loathe humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.89,0:18:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.87,0:18:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't make me like humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.56,0:18:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But you wear human clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.88,0:18:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.72,0:18:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then take them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.55,0:18:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.50,0:18:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I will devour her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I must apologize for Mr. Fu's behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.10,0:18:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Fu is a spirit, one of our clients.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.40,0:18:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.80,0:18:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't Laojun tell about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the hall manager will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.59,0:18:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, it's his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.15,0:18:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You say they have the Sky Pearl?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.18,0:18:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.14,0:18:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.24,0:18:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,When was the last time I was wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.31,0:18:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.31,0:18:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuanli has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This hole is pretty deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.95,0:18:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.87,0:18:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kali, the hall manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.40,0:18:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to our Spirit Club Hall,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.83,0:19:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuanli.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.25,0:19:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuanli is this person here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.36,0:19:17.74,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Stay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.36,0:19:17.74,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:22.48,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Our destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:22.48,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.48,0:19:27.18,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.48,0:19:27.18,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.18,0:19:33.38,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,I’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.18,0:19:33.38,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:39.53,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Wait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:39.53,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:44.33,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Even if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:44.33,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:49.01,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,When we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:49.01,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.01,0:19:55.53,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Let’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.01,0:19:55.53,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:20:06.85,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,The days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:20:06.85,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:12.27,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Are so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:12.27,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:17.31,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Those feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:17.31,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.31,0:20:28.54,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,We can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.31,0:20:28.54,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:34.09,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:34.09,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.09,0:20:40.93,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,And surely, they’re calling out to me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.09,0:20:40.93,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu
